{'symbol': 'NEE', 'date': '2021-03-19 06:45:00', 'title': 'NEXTERA ENERGY AND NEXTERA ENERGY PARTNERS TO MEET WITH INVESTORS THROUGHOUT MARCH AND EARLY APRIL', 'text': 'JUNO BEACH, FLA., MARCH 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NEXTERA ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: NEE) AND NEXTERA ENERGY PARTNERS, LP (NYSE: NEP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MEMBERS OF THE SENIOR MANAGEMENT TEAM WILL PARTICIPATE IN VARIOUS INVESTOR MEETINGS THROUGHOUT MARCH AND EARLY APRIL.'}